n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n           报名：公众号后台\n          </strong>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://www.xiaohongshu.com/goods-detail/644a98b2a4b3570001fb0864?t=1690950046400\" imgurl=\"\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(87, 107, 149);cursor: default;\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"戳这里\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍‍‍\n            </span>\n</a>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n           名额：10个位子，按照留言报名顺序哈\n          </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          特别感谢来自QIMA的全套36只杯测样本，每一支样本都只有一杯的份量，加上店里空间有限，本次杯测活动对外开放10个名额；\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          今年是也门的第六次BOY竞拍，不像往年没有在页面上分类罗列和排名次，今年几种不同的处理方式笼统在一起，一共36只，其中\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             日晒处理方式\n            </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            ： 可能是以前的精致日晒方式，共计23只\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             炼金术处理方式\n            </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            ：7只（#1/2/3/4/9/10/15）\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍‍‍‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             厌氧蜜处理\n            </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            ：这是今年新的分类，Anaerobic Fermentation Honey, 3只（#25/29/31）\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n             二氧化碳浸渍蜜处理\n            </strong>\n            ：也是今年新的分类，Carbonic Maceration Honey, 3只(#5/26/30)\n            <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n             ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n            </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;font-size: 14pt;background: rgb(217, 217, 217);font-family: 楷体;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TPj4jz7TJZdGR7BnA3tA6oaEoDnUDibw6ynAUBJ9MgiatJSGbNFvVFew8NoyuWXrypRsvyNSlntjqQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;white-space: normal;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           也门：独特的风味多样性\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          也门的咖啡风味特征反映了显著的多样性。今年，获奖咖啡展示了一系列充满活力的水果风味，包括猕猴桃、蓝莓和石榴，以及丰富而奔放的太妃糖和黑巧克力。橙子花和茉莉花等花香，加上中东特有的微气候香料风味，凸显了这些口味的复杂性。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<o:p>\n</o:p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          来自也门15个不同咖啡种植社区的36种咖啡，由全球国际评审团选出。 其中的亮点包括有13支入选批次来自女性种植者和女性种植者团体。这些拍品庆祝女性的杰出贡献及其在也门咖啡行业中的关键作用。该系列还展示了15个来自个别超小农农民的独家地块，其中一些地块只有23磅的咖啡出产，每个地块都有自己的遗产和韧性故事。 今年，蜜处理方式的批次首次出现，加入精心加工的日晒咖啡和炼金术士的行列。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FGr457cyFia7TXmY5gHeicicnTa3v7hvtYV2DAexZv3SJGrz1RZp8yIniccTTiaQu6icYNCndu3TcXA8vrCKUdxMFC3Ig%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_3666263763696287745\" data-ratio=\"0.5666666666666667\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_3666263763696287745\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-w=\"544\" frameborder=\"0\" style=\"border-radius: 4px;\">\n</iframe>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          炼金术处理方式的介绍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TPj4jz7TJZdGR7BnA3tA6odbDe0AYex77Z5WnhIak3sPXRdcpVUblVdgf9QHHcLU2qQTWibzbZLaA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          //一些相关介绍来了解也门产区\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Youtube：\n         </span>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-oiHm0wlhfM?list=RDCMUCMb0O2CdPBNi-QqPk5T3gsQ\" imgurl=\"\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"color: rgb(87, 107, 149);cursor: default;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: underline;font-size: 14px;\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"Yemenia: Bigger than Gesha?\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: underline;font-size: 14px;\">\n           Yemenia: Bigger than Gesha?\n          </span>\n</a>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n</span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           by James Hoffamnn &amp;\n           <span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n            Faris Sheibani\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Youtube:\n          <a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://youtu.be/xCe41OQnElc\" imgurl=\"\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(87, 107, 149);cursor: default;\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"Best Of Yemen 2023 官方小\">\n           Best Of Yemen 2023 官方小片1\n          </a>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://youtu.be/bSymkGmM3FQ\" imgurl=\"\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(87, 107, 149);cursor: default;\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"小片2\">\n           小片2\n          </a>\n</span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n          全世界其实小农的处境都差不多，理解了也门也能理解云南或者哥伦等小农以及竞拍能给他们带来什么，能给产区带来什么\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://www.qimacoffee.com/\" imgurl=\"\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"color: rgb(87, 107, 149);cursor: default;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;font-size: 14px;\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"QIMA 官网\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           QIMA 官网\n          </span>\n</a>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          ：首页最下面R&amp;D部分有几篇有关也门和品种调研的论文可以下载\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.476px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://link.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/s10722-021-01139-y.pdf?pdf=button\" imgurl=\"\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"cursor: default;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"Unveiling a unique genetic diversity of cultivated Coffea arabica L. in its main domestication center: Yemen\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           Unveiling a unique genetic diversity of cultivated Coffea arabica L. in its main domestication center: Yemen\n          </span>\n</a>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"cursor: default;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://www.mdpi.com/2073-4395/12/8/1970/pdf?version=1661246752\" imgurl=\"\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"cursor: default;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"Vernacular Names and Genetics of Cultivated Coffee (Coffea arabica) in Yemen\">\n           Vernacular Names and Genetics of Cultivated Coffee (Coffea arabica) in Yemen\n          </a>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://www.mdpi.com/2073-4395/12/12/3203/pdf?version=1671687439\" imgurl=\"\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"color: rgb(87, 107, 149);cursor: default;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"Deciphering Early Movements and Domestication of Coffea arabicathrough a Comprehensive Genetic Diversity Study Covering Ethiopia and Yemen\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n           Deciphering Early Movements and Domestication of Coffea arabicathrough a Comprehensive Genetic Diversity Study Covering Ethiopia and Yemen\n          </span>\n</a>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TPj4jz7TJZdGR7BnA3tA6or5Vpw0vLQic2eHFdE1E7vFzlBR2aP3jMkqD3REGhLJDGUgTElCVcwqw/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;white-space: normal;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n          BOY 官方网站：\n         </span>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://bestofyemenauction.com/\" imgurl=\"\" linktype=\"text\" style=\"outline: 0px;cursor: default;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\" tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"所有批次的详细介绍\">\n          所有批次的详细介绍\n         </a>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n          ，特别是最后一列我截屏没涵盖的MORE INFORMATION非常的详细，是这么多ACE的竞拍里做的zui细致的，今年也开始出现一些妇女小农的项目（有我们在售的Al Mahjar村落的）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TXmY5gHeicicnTa3v7hvtYV2McafbGG6USMJJGFmr5LMG16mCXZZD8XGa5ZgRGiclGsv5AGA7NNEqoQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ～明天傍晚见！\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
